+/*
+ * lavender: the frame the panel shows now, for the USB screenshot (sweet_usb.c "lv:shot"):
+ * GPU pool surfaces through the GPU driver's write-combined view, our flip buffers and the
+ * boot framebuffer through their kernel mappings. 32-bit BGRA.
